{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>深水埗富昌邨富韻樓。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>深水埗發生懷疑觸電事故。 今日（18日）早上11時許，一名女傭於深水埗富昌邨富溫樓一個單位內暈倒。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，消防破門入屋，發現女傭已經陷入昏迷，並身靠著一把風扇，救護員隨即將女傭由救護車送往明愛醫院搶救。警方正在調查事件起因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:18:46.853227+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T06:51:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T17:37:54.147018+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:17:32.601896+00:00","content_hash":"540946029e374e6cf05ffe1a49140d0c5765fa40b79089e21e8427cb5b73b2c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}